    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 28 • Job Interview 1",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Donna, a Human Resources Manager, is interviewing Marina for a sales position."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Tell me about your most recent work experience."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Right now I'm "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "between jobs"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". In my last position, I was a marketing associate at Comtek International. I was there for two and a half years."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I know I've heard of them, but I'm "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "drawing a blank"
                },
                {
                  "text": " right now. What do they do?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "They produced international trade fairs. They were "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "bought out"
                },
                {
                  "text": " last month by a much larger company and all of us were "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "let go"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I see from your résumé that you also worked in sales for the company."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yes, that's right. It was a small company, so I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "wore many hats"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". It was very exciting."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "What are you looking for in a job?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, I'm a real "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "people person"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", so I would like a position where I have lots of interaction with different people."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Describe your ideal boss."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I work well with all different types of people. But I guess my ideal boss would be hands-off. I prefer to work independently and not to be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "micro-managed."
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Tell me about a time when you had to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "think outside the box"
                },
                {
                  "text": " in your work."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "When I was at Comtek, we didn't have any money to buy advertising. I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "put in place"
                },
                {
                  "text": " a program offering magazines a stand at the trade show in exchange for an advertisement in the magazine."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That sounds like a good idea! Tell me, what "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "sparked your interest"
                },
                {
                  "text": " in our sales position?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I noticed from your job description that it requires a lot of interaction with the marketing department. I am very interested in marketing, so I thought this would be a good "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "stepping stone"
                },
                {
                  "text": " to a marketing position."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yes, this would be a good way to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "get your foot in the door"
                },
                {
                  "text": " of the marketing department."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
